<title>USA: President Casinos to open 2nd casino vessel.</title>
<headline>President Casinos to open 2nd casino vessel.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Casinos Inc said Thursday it expects to open a second casino vessel at its St. Louis operations next summer, pending receipt of timely approval for all required licenses and permits.</p>
</text>
